OL,5,G1600 Jazz Record Requests
OL,6,     FAlyn Shipton presents a
OL,7,     Fpiano-focused edition of the
OL,8,     Fprogramme, journeying from the
OL,9,     Fhard-swinging stride of the big
OL,10,     Fbands to contemporary British
OL,11,     Freleases.
OL,12,G1700 The Early Music Show
OL,13,     FHannah French traces the life of
OL,14,     Fthe Italian castrato Francesco
OL,15,     FBernardi (otherwise known as
OL,16,     FSenesino), for whom Handel wrote
OL,17,     Fmany operatic roles during his
OL,18,     Ftime working in London.
