OL,5,G1800 Choral Evensong
OL,6,     FLive from the Parish Church of St
OL,7,     FJohn-at-Hampstead, London, with
OL,8,     Fthe choir of Gonville and Caius
OL,9,     FCollege, Cambridge, to mark the
OL,10,     F100th anniversary of the death of
OL,11,     FCharles Wood.
OL,12,G1900 Sunday Feature: Whitman and
OL,13,G     Vaughan Williams
OL,14,     FVaughan Williams was devoted to
OL,15,     FWalt Whitman's poetry, carrying it
OL,16,     Fwith him and setting it often.
OL,17,     FLaura Barton explores what drew
OL,18,     Fhim so strongly to the the
OL,19,     FAmerican poet.
